---
layout: base.njk
schemaInsight: true
---

<header class="page-header"
  data-aeo-label="Article schema · This header is mapped to Schema.org Article JSON-LD. The title, summary, and date make this a dateable, attributable piece of content — AI engines prefer citing structured articles over undated pages because they can assess recency and relevance.">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Insight · {{ date | readableDate }}</p>
    <h1
      data-aeo-label="Article headline · The H1 is used as the Article.headline in JSON-LD. Write it as a clear statement of the article's finding or argument — AI engines frequently quote headlines verbatim when citing content in an answer.">
      {{ title }}
    </h1>
    <p
      data-aeo-label="Article description · This summary maps to Article.description in JSON-LD. It should be one complete, standalone sentence — AI engines use this as the pull quote when citing the article in an answer panel or footnote.">
      {{ summary }}
    </p>
  </div>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <article class="prose"
      data-aeo-label="Article body · Structure this with H2s as section headers. The first paragraph after each H2 is the most likely citation target — state the key finding immediately, before elaborating. FAQPage schema can be added to any H2 + answer pair to unlock FAQ rich results in Google and increase Perplexity citation rate.">
      {{ content | safe }}
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-tight" style="border-bottom: 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="maxifi-cta"
      data-aeo-label="Related content links · Linking insights back to /insights/ and /themes/ creates topical clustering. AI engines use co-citation patterns — if multiple insights link to the same theme, that theme page gains authority as the canonical reference for that topic.">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">More analysis</p>
        <h2>All ASW 2026 insights</h2>
        <p>Briefings, retrospectives, and operational analysis published in the run-up to and following Airspace World 2026.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="maxifi-cta-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/insights/">All insights →</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/themes/">Browse themes</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
